text = "[color=#5bc0be]-- MOVEMENT & PROPULSION --[/color]
* [color=#ffd166]W / A / S / D[/color] : Maneuver quadruped spider legs (Forward, Turn Left, Reverse, Turn Right)
* [color=#ffd166]SHIFT (Hold)[/color] : High-speed gallop propulsion sprint

[color=#5bc0be]-- WEAPONS & TARGETING SYSTEMS --[/color]
* [color=#ffd166]MOUSE[/color] : Aim turret rotation and elevate 57mm cannon barrel
* [color=#ffd166]LEFT MOUSE / SPACE[/color] : Fire 57mm Smoothbore Cannon (APFSDS Armor-Piercing)
* [color=#ffd166]RIGHT MOUSE (Hold)[/color] : Cockpit Visor High-Magnification ADS Targeting Zoom
* [color=#ffd166]V[/color] : Toggle Tactical Cockpit Visor View / 3rd Person Chassis Chase Cam
* [color=#ffd166]N[/color] : Toggle High-Gain Tactical Night Vision (NVG Phosphor Filter)
* [color=#ffd166]R[/color] : Fast Field Re-arm & Sector Reset
* [color=#ffd166]ESC[/color] : Mission Tactical Pause / Return to Base Menu"

